## Key Packages

```
com.sunmi.tapro.taplink.sdk
├── TaplinkSDK.kt                  ← Main entry class
├── TaplinkClient.kt               ← Transaction client
├── config/
│   ├── TaplinkConfig.kt           ← SDK initialization config
│   └── ConnectionConfig.kt        ← Connection mode config
├── callback/
│   ├── ConnectionListener.kt      ← Connection events
│   └── PaymentCallback.kt         ← Transaction events (progress/success/failure)
├── enums/
│   ├── ConnectionMode.kt          ← APP_TO_APP | LAN | CABLE
│   ├── CableProtocol.kt           ← AUTO | USB_AOA | USB_VSP | RS232
│   ├── CardNetworkType.kt         ← CREDIT | DEBIT
│   └── PrintReceipt.kt            ← NONE | MERCHANT | CUSTOMER | BOTH | AUTO
├── model/
│   ├── common/AmountInfo.kt       ← Amount fields (smallest currency unit!)
│   ├── common/PaymentEvent.kt     ← Transaction progress events (sealed class)
│   ├── request/transaction/       ← SaleRequest, RefundRequest, VoidRequest, etc.
│   └── response/PaymentResult.kt  ← Transaction result
└── error/
    ├── PaymentError.kt            ← Transaction error info
    └── ConnectionError.kt         ← Connection error info
```
